WEBVTT

00:58:28.921 --> 00:58:30.314
Why don't you rest?

00:58:30.338 --> 00:58:32.785
We'll try this again tomorrow.

00:58:32.809 --> 00:58:35.855
You're doing your best,
this is a hard time, and I've got you."

00:58:35.879 --> 00:58:39.316
So I've got 20 years of those journals,

00:58:39.340 --> 00:58:43.672
and I'm assuming that I'm going
to need it for the rest of my life.

00:58:45.061 --> 00:58:47.250
CA: Wow.

00:58:47.274 --> 00:58:50.119
I don't know, Helen,
I think we might be done.

00:58:50.143 --> 00:58:52.992
I think I'm done.
I can't ask any more after that.

00:58:53.016 --> 00:58:56.080
HW: How beautiful. Good grief.

00:58:56.665 --> 00:58:57.902
(CA laughs)

00:58:58.632 --> 00:59:01.568
CA: Liz, you're really phenomenal.